Advanced Riding represents a deikhan's mastery of mounted combat techniques
that transcend any particular type of mount. This foundational skill enhances
all mounted activities and combines with mount-specific riding skills to
determine overall effectiveness.

When riding, your Advanced Riding skill combines with your proficiency in
the specific mount type (domestic, nondomestic, winged, or exotic) to
calculate your mounted combat bonus. The better you are at both general
riding technique and the specific mount type, the more effective you become.

This skill affects mounted movement, combat maneuvers, and your ability to
maintain control during chaotic situations. It represents the universal
principles of balance, communication with the mount, and tactical awareness
that apply regardless of what creature you ride.

Class: Deikhan
Discipline: Mounted Combat

